     10  src=10.10.10.1  prio=5     <- MATCHES policy, CoS CHANGED 0 -> 5
     10  src=10.10.10.2  prio=0     <- does NOT match, CoS UNCHANGED
All 20 frames accounted for. Compare CONTROL above: both sources arrived at p 0
before the policy existed.
=> Traffic matching the policy map had its CoS modified; traffic not matching was
   left unchanged. STEPS 1-2 PASS.

